From: J P <jpwatters@mac.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 30/30] Project PDF for v1.20.5-NAS

The series now applies to upstream v1.20.5 (ported 2026-10-23): DIRTY_RELAY is
145 (upstream took 143 and 144), the network transport is a branch inside
upstream's own cat_tx(), upstream's raw-CAT door accepts a network link, the
SNTP hand-over keeps the microseconds, and the TX-locked refusal follows
upstream's band guard. The former KS keyer-speed patch became empty and was
dropped. The PDF names v1.20.5 as the base, with diffs against it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W7MAsxUnuCnfwkHxdqp61S
